  {*------------------------------------------------------------------
    Documento : 123456789012-FF-001   Dt.Emissao: 99/99/9999  99:99:99
    Cliente   : 12345678-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
    Cnd.Pagto : 123-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
                   (99)123.123.123.123.123.123.123.123.123.123.123.123
